The upstream libuuid/COPYING file selects the Modified BSD License and points
to Documentation/licenses/COPYING.BSD-3-Clause. The following sources listed
by libuuid/meson.build use that BSD-3-Clause notice:

libuuid/src/uuidP.h
libuuid/src/clear.c
libuuid/src/compare.c
libuuid/src/copy.c
libuuid/src/gen_uuid.c
libuuid/src/isnull.c
libuuid/src/pack.c
libuuid/src/parse.c
libuuid/src/uuidd.h
libuuid/src/uuid_time.c
libuuid/src/predefined.c
libuuid/src/unpack.c
libuuid/src/unparse.c
lib/randutils.c

The same build definition adds these public-domain helper sources:

lib/md5.c
lib/sha1.c

Their matching headers, include/md5.h and include/sha1.h, state the same
public-domain terms. include/list.h is named as a Meson source dependency but
is not included by the libuuid compilation units. It is not part of this
license selection.

The retained BSD license text and copyright notices are in this directory.
